             <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="BiographyMatthew">
                <t:label>Biography of Matthew</t:label>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>ወለማቴዎስ፡ ስሙ፡ ሌዊ፡ ወትርጓሜሁ፡ ኅሩይ፡ ወውእቱ፡
                 እምነገደ፡ ይሳኮር፡ እምሀገረ፡ ናዝሬት። ስመ፡ አቡሁ፡ ዲቁ፡ ወስመ፡ እሙ፡ ካሩትያስ።</t:ab></t:div>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>ወሰበከ፡ ባቲ፡ በህንድ፡ ወበኢየሩሳሌም።</t:ab></t:div>
             </t:div>
             <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="EusebianSectionsMatthew">
                <t:label>Statement about the Eusebian Sections in the Gospel of Matthew</t:label>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>ወኍልቈ፡ ምዕራፋቲሁ፡ ንኡሳን፡ ፫፻፶፭፡</t:ab></t:div>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>ወምዕራፉ፡ በልሳነ፡ ሮሜ። ፷፰፡</t:ab></t:div>
             </t:div>
             <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TituliMatthew">
                <t:label>Tituli of the Gospel of Matthew</t:label>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>
                <t:l n="1">፩፡ ሰብአ፡ ሰገል።</t:l>
                <t:l n="2">፪፡ ቅትለተ፡ ሕፃናት።</t:l>
                <t:l n="3">፫፡ ስብከተ፡ ዮሓንስ።</t:l></t:ab></t:div>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>
                <t:l n="66">፷፮፡ ክሕደተ፡ ጴጥሮስ።</t:l>
                <t:l n="67">፷፯፡ ነስሖተ፡ ይሁዳ።</t:l>
                <t:l n="68">፷፰፡ ዘከመ፡ ነሥአ፡ ዮሴፍ፡ ራማዊ፡ ሥጋሁ፡ ለእግዚእ።</t:l></t:ab></t:div>
              </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2709Matthew">
                <t:label>Bǝsrāta Mātewos</t:label>
               <t:div type="textpart" subtype="subtextunit" xml:id="MatthewGospelHeadline">
                 <t:label>Headline of the Gospel of Matthew</t:label>
                  <t:ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩፡ አምላክ። <t:seg type="title inscriptio expanded">ብስራተ፡ ወንጌል፡
                   ማቴዎስ፡ ሐዋርያ። አሓዱ፡ እምዓሠርቱ፡ ወክልኤቱ።</t:seg> ጸሎቱ፡ ወበረከቱ፡ የሀሉ፡ ምስለ፡ ገብሩ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis" resp="Abr"/>
                    ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን።</t:ab>
                </t:div>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="coretext" xml:id="MatthewGospel">
                  <t:label>Gospel of Matthew</t:label>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>መጽሐፈ፡ ልደቱ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ።
                  ወልደ፡ ዳዊት፡ ወልደ፡ አብርሃም። አብርሃምኒ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለይስሓቅ። ወይስሓቅኒ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለያዕቆብ።</t:ab></t:div>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>ወናሁ፡ አነ፡ ሀሎኩ፡ ምስሌክሙ፡ በኵሉ፡ መዋዕል፡ እስከ፡
                  ኅልቀተ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን።</t:ab></t:div>
                </t:div>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="colophon" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="PostscriptMatthew">
                  <t:label>Colophon of the Gospel of Matthew</t:label>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>መልአ፡ ጽሕፈተ፡ <t:seg type="title subscriptio">ብስራቱ፡
                  ለማቴዎስ፡ ሐዋርያ።</t:seg> ወኮነ፡ ጸሓፎ፡ በምድረ፡ ፍልስጥዔም፡</t:ab></t:div>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>በቀዳሚሁ፡
                  ዓ<t:choice><t:sic>ም</t:sic><t:corr resp="ABr">መ</t:corr></t:choice><t:supplied reason="omitted" resp="ABr">ተ</t:supplied>፡
                  እምቀላውዴዎስ፡ ቄሳር፡ ንጉሠ፡ ሮሜ። ጸሎቱ፡ ወበረከቱ፡ ለቅዱስ፡ ማቴዎስ፡ የሀሉ፡ ምስለ፡ ገብሩ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis" resp="Abr"/>
                  ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን።</t:ab></t:div>
                </t:div>
            </t:div>
         </t:div>
      </t:body>
   </t:text></TEI>